{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34027","headline":"奉和鲁望白菊 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已过重阳半月天，琅华千点照寒烟。\n蘂香亦似浮金靥，花样还如镂玉钱。\n玩影冯妃堪比艳，链形萧史好争妍。\n无由擿向牙箱里，飞上方诸赠列仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}